        <item>
            <title>0.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:52:33 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Dispatch 0.3.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>New tab names.</strong> Blogs is now Following, and P2s is now Automattic.</li>
  <li><strong>Switch tabs with the arrow keys.</strong> In the Reader, <kbd>←</kbd> and <kbd>→</kbd> move between Following, Automattic and Saved.</li>
  <li><strong>Back to the top.</strong> Press <kbd>⌘↑</kbd>, or click the ↑ button that appears beside the tabs once you've scrolled.</li>
  <li><strong>Calmer comments.</strong> The comments drawer stays put when you move between posts instead of sliding in again each time.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
